(2. TERM) Tj T*
T*
(2.1 This Agreement takes effect on 26 September 2026 and continues for a term of twelve \(12\) months, until) Tj T*
(25 September 2027.) Tj T*
T*
(2.2 Either Party may terminate this Agreement by giving the other Party ninety \(90\) days' written notice.) Tj T*
T*
(3. PRICE) Tj T*
T*
(3.1 The Buyer shall pay the Supplier RMB 64,000 \(sixty-four thousand yuan\) for each Batch.) Tj T*
T*
(3.2 The price of a Batch includes delivery to the Buyer's site and value-added tax.) Tj T*
T*
(4. INVOICING AND PAYMENT) Tj T*
T*
