(days, the first regular Batch on 26 October 2026, as set out in Schedule 1.) Tj T*
T*
(4.2 Each invoice is payable sixty \(60\) days after the Invoice Date.) Tj T*
T*
(4.3 The Buyer shall pay by bank transfer to the account of the Supplier stated on the invoice.) Tj T*
T*
(4.4 Payment of an invoice is subject to the Buyer's receipt of the documents listed in clause 6.) Tj T*
T*
(5. DELIVERY) Tj T*
